{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_139_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_139_1000_p", "source_sha256": "69d15a4d94d9a8342cc6bb3670d986302c35195ab18a88db546c90e1ead73528", "ja": "お疲れさま！　みんな盛り上がってるみたいだな。\n廊下まで声が聞こえてきたぞ。", "zh": "辛苦了！大家好像都很兴奋。\n在走廊都能听到你们的声音了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_139_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_139_1001_040tam", "source_sha256": "d160bea4d78c798272069ef15c477099074fa8bc6b98023156439174b569a753", "ja": "あっ、おやぶん！　エミリーと可憐お姉ちゃんも！\nたまきたち、そんなに声大きかった？", "zh": "啊，亲老大！艾米莉和可怜姐姐也在！环和大家的声音有那么大吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_139_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_139_1002_032emi", "source_sha256": "40ae5b1b28237f56b842c968d17970f5c8e0ba061d038f93a9729740d235c301", "ja": "ふふっ、みなさんの楽しそうな声が、\nはっきり聞こえてきましたよ。", "zh": "呵呵，能清楚地听到大家开心的声音呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_139_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_139_1003_045kar", "source_sha256": "da456216f2ba301e4aa70be745cb008c29d9590c8308ed41e0f346f3305f0ae1", "ja": "み、みんなの映画……私も、楽しみだな……♪\nいろんな作品に、出演したよね……。", "zh": "大、大家的电影……我也很期待呢……♪\n我们出演过各种各样的作品呢……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_139_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_139_1004_037nao", "source_sha256": "eece9b2083000b2cadcf05d17cb2b9b0cda9a7788c1149b880506195adf37ea9", "ja": "せやな～。任侠映画にホラー映画に超スポ根映画、\nいろんなジャンルに挑戦したもんな！", "zh": "是啊～任侠片、恐怖片，还有超级热血的体育电影，我们挑战过各种各样的类型呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_139_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_139_1005_018ele", "source_sha256": "944466a3562b695a53aaee98a8bfcc960d0eb011072ef987995cc2992b5c5e34", "ja": "{$P$}、イベントがあるんでしょ？\n詳しい話、早く聞かせてヨー♪", "zh": "{$P$}，有活动对吧？\n快点把详细情况告诉我吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_139_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_139_1006_p", "source_sha256": "795aed024fdd88341ae7c0270fcfa4cbe431b3f6555cd95ee920533b201ffae8", "ja": "よし、じゃあミーティングを始めようか。\nみんなには、軽く伝えたと思うけど……。", "zh": "好，那我们开始开会吧。\n虽然之前应该也跟你们稍微提过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_139_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_139_1007_p", "source_sha256": "5d671b6c23bcc89336dadfa49ae24bf0456071b7fdf2c421feeaf87dffd213ef", "ja": "765プロのアイドル達が出演した作品だけを集めて\nリバイバル上映する、映画イベントが決定したんだ。", "zh": "我们已经决定举办一场电影活动，专门重映\n765 Production旗下偶像们出演的作品。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_139_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_139_1008_p", "source_sha256": "02471ba1f970e9edf8bdec8dd4cd1b3efcd173213ae7e5e5eaafcf487e16d886", "ja": "全国の一部映画館で、1ヶ月くらいかけて\n過去の作品を上映してもらう予定だ。", "zh": "计划在全国部分电影院，用大约1个月的时间放映过去的作品。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_139_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_139_1009_040tam", "source_sha256": "3b820df4174560b0302bde73c61c936fa637931504a343cdc234592d19e403ac", "ja": "えっ、1ヶ月も！？\nすごいね！", "zh": "诶，要放映1个月！？  \n太厉害了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_139_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_139_1010_p", "source_sha256": "8f206ee7045905d78232d31092aa03cfddecaee0d75bc4e17ca9f368dbf11689", "ja": "ああ。上映期間中は舞台挨拶なんかもあるから、\nみんなにはあちこち行ってもらう事になる。", "zh": "嗯。因为上映期间还会有舞台问候之类的活动，\n所以得让大家去各个地方。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_139_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_139_1011_p", "source_sha256": "be06308c378e8d3f5cdce00078b64ca50624c4f3c0c6260bef193376b3d18ba2", "ja": "スケジュール的に調整が難しいかもしれないから、\n何人かずつになると思うけど……よろしくな！", "zh": "因为日程安排上可能不太好协调，应该会分成几个人一组……就拜托大家了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_139_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_139_1012_032emi", "source_sha256": "9586e6d485cc5831f8c1aba58ba83e7cb93a6cbc89c20669c25179f5808fa4dc", "ja": "まあ、舞台挨拶……！\nごヒイキ様方にもお会いできるのですね！", "zh": "原来还有映后见面会……！也能见到一直支持我的各位贵客了呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_139_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_139_1013_045kar", "source_sha256": "2dae212c351a2dba1855aea285880a00fb8ca9514b38cd3bf5c1ca6f5ece6e53", "ja": "う、うれしいです……♪　みなさんに挨拶できるのも、\nまた、映画を観てもらえるのも……！", "zh": "好、好开心……♪ 能向大家打招呼，还有能让大家再次看到电影……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_139_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_139_1014_018ele", "source_sha256": "e0b6fe607d97e7dcad9841cda05cba9921d095c071c3870891825c9c758f38fe", "ja": "うんうん！　ファンのみんなと一緒に\n観られるなんて、うれしいよネ♪", "zh": "嗯嗯！能和粉丝们一起看，\n真的好开心呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_139_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_139_1015_037nao", "source_sha256": "d2728a7dea5d92994c03cb4507bd8bdfd6d6e793eb2ebf48cd9259024bc52ed1", "ja": "ホンマやな！　メッチャ盛り上げて、\nたくさんの人たちに見てもらわな！", "zh": "确实如此！得把气氛炒得热热闹闹的，让更多人来看才行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_139_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_139_1016_040tam", "source_sha256": "d5e80bedc680fe5ef86649b8c22d2bfc2ddbfea630d7cc8e5502fa68ed66ef65", "ja": "たまきも、いっぱい盛り上げるぞ～！\nねぇおやぶん、毎日舞台あいさつしてもいい？", "zh": "环也要让气氛嗨起来～！\n呐，老大，我每天都去做舞台问候可以吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_139_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_139_1017_p", "source_sha256": "7c719a294348d6cb622d0c9560f8f30f781e366626e0c3b7c1d0d80feb8d0ba0", "ja": "毎日か。盛り上がりそうだけど、環には\n他の仕事もあるから、スケジュールと相談かな。", "zh": "每天吗。感觉会很热闹，不过环还有其他工作，还是得和日程安排商量一下。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_139_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_139_1018_p", "source_sha256": "3eb3fc5b99b1923f4a9aa815237a6c17b9ec8ccf8f926a5c0168d18f53bd2df7", "ja": "みんな、1ヶ月間忙しくなると思うけど、\nいいイベントにしような！", "zh": "大家，接下来的1个月里应该会很忙，\n不过我们要办出一场精彩的活动！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
